[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 25141.75, "timestamp": "06:59:01", "text": "棄光者一樣是重罪。後來，我聽說他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25143.67, "timestamp": "06:59:03", "text": "因為偷竊被抓了。當他們發現他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25145.51, "timestamp": "06:59:05", "text": "是腐化者時，就把他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25147.35, "timestamp": "06:59:07", "text": "直接送到了安全局。就像我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25149.75, "timestamp": "06:59:09", "text": "說的，腐化者是無藥可醫的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25150.15, "timestamp": "06:59:10", "text": "所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25150.628, "timestamp": "06:59:10", "text": "這算是好事。還能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25152.39, "timestamp": "06:59:12", "text": "怎麼辦？他算是罪有應得。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25154.628, "timestamp": "06:59:14", "text": "但即便如此，我們還是當了幾年的朋友"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25156.31, "timestamp": "06:59:16", "text": "。我無法忍受"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25158.07, "timestamp": "06:59:18", "text": "他躺在冰冷的莫格監獄裡，所以我偷偷把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25160.07, "timestamp": "06:59:20", "text": "他救了出來。我當時正要離開。把他埋了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25162.788, "timestamp": "06:59:22", "text": "等等。我很好奇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25163.83, "timestamp": "06:59:23", "text": "什麼症狀？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25165.19, "timestamp": "06:59:25", "text": "我不知道，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25166.948, "timestamp": "06:59:26", "text": "但我聽說有些人會變得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25169.35, "timestamp": "06:59:29", "text": "極度暴力，有些人則不會。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25171.59, "timestamp": "06:59:31", "text": "不過，這些都只是傳聞。如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25174.39, "timestamp": "06:59:34", "text": "對此感興趣，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25176.39, "timestamp": "06:59:36", "text": "哦不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25178.788, "timestamp": "06:59:38", "text": "我明白了。我突然看不清"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25180.948, "timestamp": "06:59:40", "text": "後面，結果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25184.708, "timestamp": "06:59:44", "text": "驚擾了那個怪物般的普賽克。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25187.67, "timestamp": "06:59:47", "text": "是誰？普賽克失明會不會是病情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25189.19, "timestamp": "06:59:49", "text": "惡化的症狀？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25194.31, "timestamp": "06:59:54", "text": "先生，許普諾斯擁有的所有鑑定器，我想打聽"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25197.11, "timestamp": "06:59:57", "text": "某個人。希望您能坦誠相待，並給予"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25198.708, "timestamp": "06:59:58", "text": "支持。"}]